  "description": "Works to a tree with a TPO: Works in accordance with DE Licence\rTree ID 6684       A Plum tree approximately 8m in height, situated in the rear garden in the far left-hand corner.  The main stem of this tree is positioned in direct, intimate contact with the rear boundary wall, separating the property from College Road. Complete removal of the tree is the only viable option to mitigate the safety hazard and prevent the full collapse of the boundary wall onto the public pavement and allow the wall to be repaired. There is a more ornamental Prunus serrula adjacent to the above tree which must be left to develop and provide a suitable feature on the same side.",
